00:02:43.166 --> 00:02:46.843
Sometimes coordinates or Boolean
or some things like that, yes,

00:02:46.844 --> 00:02:49.940
that's true, but
most of the time they are real.

00:02:49.941 --> 00:02:52.160
In this course,
