00:08:54.668 --> 00:08:55.648
Think about that.

00:08:55.649 --> 00:08:58.280
Okay, so
high dimensional geometry.

00:08:58.281 --> 00:09:03.210
So far what we have seen is
that we've seen that data

00:09:03.211 --> 00:09:06.659
can be represented, usefully, if
you believe me, and we have to

00:09:06.660 --> 00:09:09.590
still demonstrate that,
in very high dimensional space.

00:09:09.591 --> 00:09:12.300
As an example,
D is in the billions, right?

00:09:12.301 --> 00:09:15.640
So it's still feasible,
because it's sparse, but

00:09:15.641 --> 00:09:18.190
it's in the billions,
so we've seen that.

00:09:18.191 --> 00:09:20.400
So it would be nice to see what

